  "scope": "Interruptible syscall/HAL return acknowledgement; private external E1000 INTx; standalone SDK packaging and native acceptance; compositor startup presentation ordering. Parallel source work, serialized OS builds/VMs.",
  "limits": [
    "TCG only; no /dev/kvm. No performance scaling or physical input-to-photon claim.",
    "Applications remain UP with dispatch_cpus=1; AP probe workers do not dispatch applications.",
    "CPL0 ordinary IPI delivery and syscall handback verified natively; CPL3 IPI capture tested with actual Rust boundary module on host.",
    "Remote stop/cancel, lock ranking, bounded IRQ-off critical sections and concurrent application VM/fault gates remain open.",
    "E1000 external probe is opt-in and private; no packet capabilities, netd, Ethernet/IP stack or socket SDK supplied.",
    "Standalone SDK requires matching nightly/rust-src and host tools. Native execution delegates to a compatible full OS checkout. No project license grant inferred."
